  "content": "<h5><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPUfzJu.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></h5>\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 100+ 任務</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全面重製的世界生成 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic,</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/promenade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Promenade</a>)</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 完全優化並支援着色器</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 自訂 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" rel=\"nofollow\">着色器預設</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 重製的 stronghold 與要塞</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全新 Boss 與生物 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction,</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frostiful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frostiful)</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 數百個全新迷宮與建築結構 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures)</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 生活品質提升功能，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗值儲存</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a> 並附加額外功能</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 眾多自訂功能以改善遊戲體驗</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 內建且 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免費分享世界</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 超過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f64017%252fbetter-mc-fabric-bmc2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">280 個模組</a></strong></h5>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:399px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yEDj3QS45X4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"399\" height=\"249\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:417px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/h2CLjWebHQg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"417\" height=\"248\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>本產品非官方 Minecraft 產品。未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准或關聯。</strong></span></h5>",
